 ## Background
-Originated from a project by CS184 students, implementing a fire simulation and rendering pipeline [S1, unofficial]. The rendering technique borrows from existing literature on volumetric clouds [S8]. The fire rendering approach is similar to smoke rendering but uses reaction coordinate accumulation [S2, unofficial]. A more physically based discussion of fire rendering can be found in Nguyen et al. 2002 [S2, unofficial].
